WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.185
Titan, and the farthest we have landed.

00:02.885 --> 00:08.351
The air at the ground presses half again as hard as Earth's, and the lakes under the haze are methane.

00:08.821 --> 00:16.026
Huygens came down through it on 14 January 2005 and sent for ninety minutes from the surface.

00:16.597 --> 00:20.128
Nothing has landed further from home, before or since.
